# form only: no LANCE-staked game was played, so none is claimed. No price / returns language.)
voice = en-GB-RyanNeural
hook     | +10% | +0Hz | You earn in one app, and play in another.
silo     | +12% | -1Hz | But each app keeps its own balance.
intro    | +10% | -1Hz | LanceHub is one shared pool behind both.
